            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          },
          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
            "y": 13.245033112582783,
            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Early Life of Carl Sagan</strong><br>\nCarl Sagan was born on November 9, 1934, in Brooklyn, New York. From a young age, he was curious about the stars, inspired by the World's Fair and library books about the planets. Sagan turned his childhood fascination into his life's work, pursuing studies in physics and astronomy. By the age of 22, he had earned a master's degree, and a Ph.D. by 26. His early academic career set the stage for his work as an esteemed astronomer and astrophysicist.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Sagan's Work in Astronomy</strong><br>\nCarl Sagan contributed to our understanding of the solar system through his research on planetary atmospheres, particularly the greenhouse effect on Venus and seasonal changes on Mars. He suggested that Venus's high surface temperatures were due to a runaway greenhouse effect, a theory later confirmed by space probes. His work also included a study of Mars's surface, including dust storms and climate, which significantly impacted space exploration.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Pioneer of Exobiology</strong><br>\nSagan was a pioneer in the field of exobiology, which is the study of the possibility of life beyond Earth. He speculated on the conditions needed for life in the universe and the likelihood of extraterrestrial beings. His enthusiasm for discovering life on other planets drove him to encourage the search for intelligent extraterrestrial life through projects such as SETI (Search for Extraterrestrial Intelligence).</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "53bc5361-5ce5-43a9-a00f-57bbceee9cd0"
            },
            "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
            "backgroundOpacity": 0,
            "displayAsButton": false,
            "buttonSize": "big",
